{"final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006.","value":6,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:q11n3","source:q11n4"],"result_id":"tool:2","explanation":"Per the product warranties note, the reserve was $10 million as of Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million as of Dec. 31, 2005. Change = 10 - 4 = 6 million USD."}}